供</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:06:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/fortnite-maker-epic-games-confirms-huge-pivot-towards-using-ai</guid></item><item><title>物理学家在实验室里建造了一个黑洞。然后它吞掉了声音</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/physicists-built-a-black-hole-in-a-lab-then-it-swallowed-sound</link><description>声音可能是一头难以驾驭的棘手野兽。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/physicists-built-a-black-hole-in-a-lab-then-it-swallowed-sound.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:51:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/physicists-built-a-black-hole-in-a-lab-then-it-swallowed-sound</guid></item><item><title>现在可以提前几年发现帕金森病的令人惊讶的方法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-surprising-ways-parkinsons-can-now-be-spotted-years-early</link><description>一波新的突破性技术可以在主要症状出现前数年甚至数十年检测出这种疾病&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-surprising-ways-parkinsons-can-now-be-spotted-years-early.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:36:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-surprising-ways-parkinsons-can-now-be-spotted-years-early</guid></item><item><title>磁力雕刻以数学精度将单源场转变为预定形状</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/magnetic-sculpting-transforms-single-source-fields-into-predetermined-shapes-with-mathematical-precision</link><description>磁场是从 MRI 扫描仪和粒子加速器到原子钟和未来量子计算机等技术中看不见但必不可少的组成部分。这些应用中的每一个都需要具有特定形状和属性的磁场。如今，创建这种定制的磁场需要研究人员和工程师为每个单独的应用设计专门的、精心优化的磁体或大型线圈系统，这是一个复杂且资源密集的过程。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/magnetic-sculpting-transforms-single-source-fields-into-predetermined-shapes-with-mathematical-precision.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:21:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/magnetic-sculpting-transforms-single-source-fields-into-predetermined-shapes-with-mathematical-precision</guid>